<title>USA: Ultratech Stepper to take Q1 charge.</title>
<headline>Ultratech Stepper to take Q1 charge.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ultratech Stepper Inc said it completed the acquisition of Lepton Inc, and as a result it expects to report a one-time charge in the first quarter of 1997 of about $0.12 per share.</p>
<p>The company said the charge represents the cost of in-process research and development.</p>
<p>Lepton is a developer of high-performance electron beam lithography systems.</p>
